otyped and distinctive fashion, implying artistic contacts and common customs. Commemorative stelae and statues in the round are found in some quantity, and the figures, whether human or divine, are often supported on podia flanked by paired lions.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2793, 'temperature': 0.2})
